OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly
OL,6,Fcloudy this evening and early tonight
OL,7,Fwith some rain or showers, especially
OL,8,Fin the south. Turning clearer in the
OL,9,Fearly hours then some heavy showers
OL,10,Freaching the northwest towards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA dry start in south and
OL,13,Feast, but occasionally heavy showers
OL,14,Fin north and west spreading across
OL,15,Fmost areas, with the chance of thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
